WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.912 --> 00:00:13.888
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:27.700
Hi, Stillwater.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:29.020
Hello, Karl.

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:31.040
What are you doing?

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:31.774
Tree Pose.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.590
I'm a tree too.

00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:41.210
Yes, you are.

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:44.540
In yoga, we do it like this, foot

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:49.250
pressed against the inner thigh, hands pressed together.

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:50.420
Very nice.

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:53.280
Now, breathe in and out slowly.

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:01.270
It's hard.

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:03.580
It does take some practice.

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:08.510
Try putting your hands down here in front of your chest.

00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:09.215
That's easier.

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:13.050
Ah.

00:01:18.726 --> 00:01:23.945
[LAUGHS]

00:01:23.945 --> 00:01:26.290
Are you practicing yoga?

00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:28.375
No, we're practicing being trees.

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:34.260
Tree Pose is yoga, Karl.

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:34.760
Oh.

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:42.050
Now, put your leg out and stretch your arms wide.

00:01:42.050 --> 00:01:44.105
This is called tipping star.

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:52.970
Why are you all standing on one leg?

00:01:52.970 --> 00:01:54.470
Because we're tippy stars.

00:01:54.470 --> 00:01:57.080
It's called yoga.

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:58.910
I've done yoga.

00:01:58.910 --> 00:01:59.870
Can you do this one?

00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:05.290
Very good.

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:06.940
Downward-Facing Dog, Michael.

00:02:10.759 --> 00:02:13.910
This pose can recenter our focus.

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:18.260
Now, if we move our bodies like this,

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:20.900
we're in Upward-Facing Dog.

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:23.010
Breathe in.

00:02:23.010 --> 00:02:23.705
Breathe out.

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:32.570
Would you like to try Cat-Cow next?

00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:34.685
What's a Cat-Cow?

00:02:34.685 --> 00:02:38.570
I know that one, cat, cow.

00:02:38.570 --> 00:02:42.800
Oh, I get it, cat, cow.

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:45.120
Breathe in.

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:45.800
Breathe out.

00:02:48.470 --> 00:02:51.730
Now, follow along with me.

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:53.680
Cobra, breathe in.

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:59.310
Breathe out.

00:02:59.310 --> 00:03:01.335
Lunge, breathe in.

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:04.440
Breathe out.

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:12.040
Airplane, breathe in.

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:15.070
Breathe out.

00:03:15.070 --> 00:03:17.920
Happy Baby, breathe in.

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:21.840
Breathe out.

00:03:29.818 --> 00:03:32.610
Shavasana, breathe in.

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:36.520
Breathe out.

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:49.170
[MUSIC PLAYING]

